From 1848d52b948da3f4e7a87c68afc7b55f9e2320c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aaron <aaronmedeiros@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 11:27:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gpu-next: add active image aspect management

Measure native luma asynchronously, publish frame-tagged active-image geometry, and support frame-exact wide-canvas framing plus independent detected-bar cropping. Stabilize encoded matte noise, sparse and windowboxed frames, breakouts, micro aperture motion, and faint structured fade-ins with analysis-only lookahead. Preserve user and fullscreen-UI source crops without changing picture scale, and provide a default-on switch that removes analysis and lookahead overhead when disabled.
---
 player/command.c        |   34 ++
 video/out/vo.h          |   15 +
 video/out/vo_gpu_next.c | 1175 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 1222 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

